  m_text: Tow the trailer into the low loading cradle and stop. ACTION uncouples
    and locks the physical sling when the trailer is supported inside the cradle.
    ACTION again releases the counterweight arm; steering adjusts auxiliary winch
    power before launch. ACTION during the swing releases the actual trailer at its
    current velocity. Timing is everything. A settling trailer is scored from its
    genuine landing position and target impacts. The arm, counterweight, sling and
    trailer are physical bodies.
